{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_title", "source_sha256": "b5a3bd88a3c7f9bbcca6b702c793bdc9b854de6d3113d9ec07837610b1e167ce", "ja": "お待ちしてます、ね……？", "zh": "我等您喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7695315040021d050a8bb5b1fb20ea4f9c2ab399293b3e21a5a001075d0a0899", "ja": "ヤンデレカフェを題材にしたドラマの\nスピンオフ作品に出演が決まった星梨花と\n琴葉。いつもとちょっと違うコンセプトの\nステージに挑むアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "星梨花和琴叶确定出演一部以病娇咖啡馆为题材的电视剧衍生作品。这是偶像们挑战与平时略有不同概念的舞台时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76f3bdd68e884ddea74a2f5b66124eb0047aae257395ca3373d882b760ccd1e3", "ja": "（以前、昴、亜美、エミリー、志保がヤンデレカフェで\n働く少女達を演じた、『病みYummyキッチン』……）", "zh": "（之前，昴、亚美、艾米莉、志保曾在以病娇咖啡厅为题材的《病娇Yummy厨房》中，饰演在那里工作的少女们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9509fd22175ecba4c91aedf8fafa1a03a8bef9848fdc395fcc2c0d78f6f84c7f", "ja": "（それが好評だったため、スピンオフドラマが\n制作される事になった。今回出演するアイドルは……）", "zh": "（由于反响很好，决定制作衍生剧。这次出演的偶像是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "5fca25d9f6eedaada8bf76b46f75b25764c26ab290cf8f9367adfb0b8ab68c71", "ja": "「あなたに会えてうれしいなっ♪\nわたし、ずーっと待ってたんですよ？」", "zh": "「能见到你我好开心呀♪\n我可是一～直在等着的哦？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "510e1d00b3e8011e1fa21bdfb5ffc4237bf85e76d88e2d196436770b382c803d", "ja": "「私に会いに来てくれたんですよね？　……他の子に\n会いに来たなんて言われたら、耐えられない……！」", "zh": "「你是特意来见我的吧？……要是你说是来见其他人的，我可承受不了……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "d6d749818ad61aad38b9c61bf2286a4fb52a947a41faf421c810ef1b91a7e827", "ja": "ワアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ebd46b48f5857eb77b0dc22a109df912b212dcd09fef6024f8f47e2baaa7942", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　わたしは、『ぴえぴえ\n(;ω;)かふぇ』キャストのせりかです！　そして……", "zh": "谢谢大家♪我是“哭哭\n(;ω;)咖啡厅”的演员星梨花！然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "610c333d3de1983090bcfc597028e72b5a24b4c2d18d1abce788a8b5b41c4912", "ja": "『ぴえぴえ(;ω;)かふぇ』キャストの、\nことはです。よ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我是“呜呜(;ω;)咖啡厅”的店员，\n琴叶。请、请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "a0544d2a1093a6f833a68106884f163f801b6bea3e22e2542f8c9a6760ff5032", "ja": "今回、私と星梨花ちゃんは、ヤンデレカフェの\nキャスト役なんですけど……あの、どうでしたか？", "zh": "这次，我和星梨花负责扮演病娇咖啡厅的店员……那个，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "2a0c4a912fb6656118fd3eb67d6d55e070788e888f42df9be18e46e88c7fd1c5", "ja": "最高ー！", "zh": "太棒了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "50f4a3a474a4eafc72fc301fc210f860ad46c41d051383fb20bc766d4ca4069f", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\n喜んでもらえてよかったですね、琴葉さん♪", "zh": "哇，谢谢您！\n能让您开心真是太好了，琴叶小姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "e6a93a7379daa758b3e357245082e90c039ba4b2eae4dc4385fb76eecbc2a2d4", "ja": "そうだね、ホッとしたかも……。というわけで、今日の\nステージは『ヤンデレ』をコンセプトにお届けします！", "zh": "是啊，可能是松了口气吧……那么，今天的舞台就以“病娇”为主题，为大家呈现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "40967a506bbd0f66b416e71a0f3ebc58213041916bab6dc7e425d6c9d54c964c", "ja": "わたしたちのお店『ぴえぴえ(;ω;)かふぇ』は、\n亜美さんたちのお店とライバル関係なんですよね？", "zh": "我们开的店“呜呜汪汪(;ω;)咖啡厅”，\n和亚美小姐她们的店是对手关系，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "48ffff6845a67b387eb143a05e58b927959886c0d5241b1712782192588ab0ef", "ja": "そうそう！　みんな、亜美たちの\n『病みYummyキッチン』も、よろしくねー！", "zh": "对对！大家也请多多关照亚美她们的『病Yummy厨房』哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "409a03b17ba4f1a4037422e0b1cdec5e0ee1e017dbd765ddbe6984991bf19eee", "ja": "来てくれないと……亜美、ファンの兄ちゃん\n姉ちゃんの家まで、迎えに行っちゃうかもよ～？", "zh": "你们要是不来……亚美说不定会直接去粉丝哥哥姐姐家里接你们哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "c6aeb206a4a89e6131bb3cc2c4d63dac07c9c6aa2fe96fa90cfd679823e9c610", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "5bb0cd69d6980bc3705ee9416cc0a7aa77f6a3b6b91b9b17008bfbc664869a4d", "ja": "あら……まさか、家凸する気ですの？\nそれはいけませんわ、亜美。", "zh": "哎呀……难不成你打算直接闯到人家家里去吗？\n那可不行啊，亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "7a9d7e5dd74e0b5a8e5003a8e4bf68df41572fa3b5a2e17078445eb0f0309885", "ja": "いくらヤンデレカフェとはいえ、お客様ですもの。\nせめて、待ち伏せくらいにしてくださいまし！", "zh": "就算再怎么说是病娇咖啡厅，对方也是客人啊。\n至少也请换成埋伏蹲点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "83a3b2e009c1d8edd69db9f3aff594c73468c1bf38e46b42305f5e8dfa4fc10b", "ja": "せやな、千鶴の言うとおりやと思うわ！\n……で、家凸って何？　あと待ち伏せもアカンよな？", "zh": "对啊，我也觉得千鹤说得没错！……不过，“上门突袭”是什么意思？还有，埋伏也不行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1255edae44ceba91661f291f85a24fe6f1a8b159533d35cf985fc54a8b3bb6c7", "ja": "えっと、家凸は直接家に行くこと……かな？\n待ち伏せも、相手に迷惑が掛かるからやめた方が……。", "zh": "那个，所谓上门骚扰，就是直接去对方家里……吧？\n埋伏也会给对方添麻烦，还是不要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "3830d536bcc337c374b9b1947b9103fb1519ca2bbf29b5e2c916b3765b751792", "ja": "ええっ、そうなの！？　ヤンデレカフェって、\nメーワク掛けられるのがソダイゴミなんじゃないの！？", "zh": "诶，是这样的吗！？病娇咖啡厅不就是要被添麻烦才最有意思吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "f95c288c3835cc278cb5b3f6f0ef876fb70b1e6a978e86cabf9c59b2c5c27544", "ja": "ソダイゴミ……あっ、醍醐味のこと？\nそういうわけじゃないと思うけど……。", "zh": "“粗大垃圾”……啊，你是说“醍醐味”吗？我觉得应该不是那么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "3a277ede4f88b8dcec69bc1366b8c06f2d8c94e2dd44dc45ab856cdf7a4dfefa", "ja": "だいたい、亜美はコンカフェの店員さんやろ？\nお店に来てもらわんと、商売上がったりやんな？", "zh": "说到底，亚美是女仆咖啡店的店员吧？\n要是不来店里，生意可就没法做了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "39a7363424592ae01b2c849b18ced731fb604586c998b227f8d24e37a599f3ff", "ja": "ああっ、そうだった！\nうあうあ、風花お姉ちゃん、どうしよ～！？", "zh": "啊，对了！  \n呜啊呜啊，风花姐姐，怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15e89ec495b91533e6605e5e260dc93bc60461110793bbd435eae6c14939878b", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、亜美ちゃん。ここにいるお客さん達は\n優しいから、お願いすればきっと来てくれると思うな。", "zh": "没事的，亚美。这里的观众们都很温柔，只要拜托他们，我觉得一定愿意来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e4ae81019f62e4a55edacd84f3a5b3b558410bce4d6a7efc9167bf18663daf78", "ja": "みなさん、そうですよね？\nまた私たちに、会いに来てくれますよね……？", "zh": "大家，对吧？\n下次还会再来看我们……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1025_audience", "source_sha256": "f6c669aaa5452986b6259a2131f600dec827f78f01b7f521d209eae2b76dd1b2", "ja": "ヒュ～～～！！！", "zh": "呜～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "6abc37451ffbafef12391af297355adaa82025c6ccddb001bb1dae8dbacf66ef", "ja": "わぁ……♪　みなさん、すごいです！\nヤンデレのお芝居も、バッチリですね♪", "zh": "哇……♪　大家，好厉害啊！\n病娇的戏份也演得非常到位呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b026ee501623c78cde4e5b76cd38a1c9b480045cee5aab87e9f68df4eb68a0f", "ja": "うん。同じヤンデレでも、みんな個性があって……\n私もなんだか、ドキッとしちゃいました。", "zh": "嗯。同样是病娇，大家也各有各的特色……\n连我都不由得有些心跳加速了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_134_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_134_ng_01_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "c3a87a306d62b4d57db6a27dbae8aa55024d9bacca4bcd0118897dbc2122235c", "ja": "今日は、そんないつもと違う私たちと過ごす、\nドキドキの時間を……。", "zh": "今天，就请和与平时不一样的我们一起度过这段心跳不已的时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
